         form, grants rights in any Design embodied therein only to the extent
         that such Design is disclosed in that Source form; and

    (v) nothing in this subsection (b) grants You any right to require, compel,
        or otherwise extend disclosure of the Source form of the Work or any
        Design embodied therein.

(c) Termination on Design Litigation. If You institute Design infringement
    litigation against any entity (including a cross-claim or counterclaim in
