7.2 Non-Assertion Where Waiver Is Not Permitted. To the extent that any such
right cannot be waived under applicable law, the relevant Right Holder or
Contributor agrees not to assert that right against You for so long as You
exercise the rights granted under this License and comply with its applicable
terms.

7.3 Scope. The waiver and non-assertion under this Section apply only with
respect to the Work and the relevant Contributor's own Contribution, as
applicable, and only in relation to You. Nothing in this Section waives or
limits any right with respect to a person other than You or with respect to a
work other than the Work or the relevant Contribution.

7.4 Independence from License Termination. The waiver and non-assertion under
this Section are independent of, and are not conditioned upon, the continued
effectiveness of any patent license granted under Section 3 of this License.
The termination of a patent license under Section 3, or any other termination
or breach under this License, does not reinstate or revive any moral-rights
claim with respect to uses occurring before that termination.

7.5 Binding Effect Upon Succession. To the fullest extent permitted by
applicable law, the waiver and non-assertion under this Section bind each
relevant Right Holder's or Contributor's Successors.

7.6 Contributions. By submitting a Contribution, each Contributor agrees to be
bound by this Section with respect to that Contribution.

